What this licence covers

This licence covers this repository's own code and original assets only. It
does not cover, and grants no rights in, the following, which remain their
owners' and are used under their own terms:

- The Balatro assets: the shaders, textures, sound effects and music that
  frontend/lua/build.mjs copies at build time from a separate Balatro source
  tree. They are not stored in this repository. Balatro is by LocalThunk and
  published by Playstack.
- The m6x11plus font, by Daniel Linssen (managore), which the build copies
  from the same Balatro source tree.
- The LÖVE runtime and its love.js WebAssembly port, and the libraries they
  include, under their own licences (zlib for LÖVE, MIT for love.js).
- TCGdex card data and card images, including the card scans in
  frontend/lua/assets/transition_cards/.
- Pokémon names, trademarks and card artwork, which belong to Nintendo,
  Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company.

Colorless is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed,
sponsored or approved by Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc., The
Pokémon Company, LocalThunk or Playstack.

The notices for the third-party parts that ship with the site are generated
by the build into dist/love/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and served at
/love/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt (scripts/third-party-notices.ts).
